<title>USA: Nuko names Sekar as CFO.</title>
<headline>Nuko names Sekar as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>NUKO Information Systems Inc said Friday it had named Ramesh Sekar as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Tom Spanier, a consultant who has served the past two months as interim CFO, will continue to work with the executive staff to achieve a smooth transition, it said.</p>
</text>
